### Storefront requests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client). Start choco-portal first (dev profile).

@host = http://localhost:8085

### Browse (public)
GET {{host}}/home/content

###
GET {{host}}/product/search?keyword=caramel&sort=3

### Products without peanuts or tree nuts (allergen ids come from the reference list)
GET {{host}}/product/search?excludeAllergens=5,6

###
GET {{host}}/product/detail/1

### Sign in as the demo customer
# @name login
POST {{host}}/sso/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "demo", "password": "Demo@12345" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Add six single bonbons... or a box of 6 built from two flavors (product 47 is Build-a-box)
POST {{host}}/cart/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 47, "skuId": 1, "quantity": 1,
  "box": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 4 }, { "productId": 2, "quantity": 2 } ] }

###
GET {{host}}/cart/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Price the basket (coupon, points, fees) without ordering
POST {{host}}/order/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cartItemIds": [1], "fulfillmentType": "PICKUP", "giftSleeve": true, "giftMessage": "Enjoy!" }

### Place the order, then pay it (tok_decline simulates a declined card)
POST {{host}}/order/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cartItemIds": [1], "fulfillmentType": "PICKUP" }

###
POST {{host}}/payment/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "orderId": 1, "method": "CARD", "cardToken": "tok_ok" }

### Ask for a personalised plaque
POST {{host}}/personalization/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "kind": "NAME_PLAQUE", "text": "Happy Birthday Mia", "quantity": 1, "neededBy": "2026-12-20" }

### Book seats at a tasting
GET {{host}}/experience/list

###
POST {{host}}/experience/book
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sessionId": 1, "seats": 2 }
